{"seq":12,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T02:30:13.208Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"e32b92724e2ae8822b377b5e2981dfff325dfce044bbecb58b79c045296d32f4","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's digests give me (latest first):\n\n• Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia's account until the handoff. The 5/4/2026 digest says Nadia's old industrial account was reassigned in the CRM effective 2026-05-04. Gideon's 7/1 post in this channel calls Vantorre Group \"Nadia's old industrial account\", and the 8/3 and 9/30 digests show Gideon running it. So the change of hands date is May 4, 2026.\n• Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The digests have called it his fleet account since 7/7/2025, and the 9/30/2026 digest has him on it.\n• Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia's medical account in the 3/10/2025 digest. The 12/1/2025 and 9/30/2026 digests refer to \"Gideon's medical account\" without naming Orlavine, and it's the only medical account in the pod's list. I'd confirm that one before it goes on the slide.\n• Quillfeather Outfitters: the digests never name an owner. They only call it the pod's outdoor/retail account. Nadia is the one hosting its gate-clerk training, so it's probably hers, but that's inference. Please confirm with Nadia.\n\nThe digests are loose on one point. The 9/15/2025 one mentions an account Gideon \"took over in August\" without naming it. I didn't count it toward Vantorre Group, since the 5/4/2026 entry is the explicit reassignment.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":13,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T02:30:18.198Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"e7460a6d2bad41841cbc884eb40aa8a3621f28ae8e751bc6fb0991a4fdf6350a","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I replied to Ruth in the #strategic-pod thread. Here is what I told her, based on Moss's Strategic digests:\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4/2026 digest says it was reassigned from Nadia in the CRM effective **2026-05-04**, so that is the change-of-hands date. Gideon's 7/1 post in the channel calls it \"Nadia's old industrial account,\" and the 8/3 and 9/30 digests show Gideon running it.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The digests have called it his fleet account since 7/7/2025.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. The 3/10/2025 digest calls it Nadia's medical account. The 12/1/2025 and 9/30/2026 digests refer to \"Gideon's medical account\" without naming Orlavine. It is the only medical account on the list, so I told Ruth to confirm it before it goes on the slide.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** The digests never name an owner. Nadia is hosting its gate-clerk training, so it is probably hers, but I flagged that as inference and suggested Ruth confirm with Nadia.\n\nI also told Ruth the 9/15/2025 digest mentions an unnamed account Gideon \"took over in August.\" I did not count it toward Vantorre Group, because the 5/4/2026 entry is the explicit reassignment.\n\nI only used channels Ruth belongs to and no finance figures."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
